{
 "batchId": "b-0103",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "zh-Hans",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_cf54ec66491f54382d18",
   "sourceHash": "cf54ec66491f54382d1860866fa43dd6362587221d572e74e88d66b5a4cbcfda",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]我们自然、非侵入性的方法帮助患者掌握长期自我护理的知识，并提升整体健康状况。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'clients' rendered as 患者 (patients) per clinical register."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3e2dd5ef8c582529c151",
   "sourceHash": "3e2dd5ef8c582529c15138f36932ac1a1fe22468a8787b8050791619d151fefe",
   "text": "您的阿育吠陀神经健康与功能疗法",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7923665eaf8687955e9d",
   "sourceHash": "7923665eaf8687955e9d9eb6e39dbb8ed929e95d85d19de2390838cc4a6e6fae",
   "text": "应对神经系统疾病让我不堪重负，因此我一直在寻找一种全面的方法。在 Kairali 的这段时间改变了我的生活。接受了包括舒缓按摩和草本油在内的个性化治疗后，我感到更加稳定、踏实。阿育吠陀医生制定的治疗方案包括饮食调整、冥想和少量运动，对我的进步很有帮助。离开 Kairali 时，我的身体和精神都更加强健了。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_70c3f64965d3d4355c52",
   "sourceHash": "70c3f64965d3d4355c5264a8fa91d018be616fed2ed7656f0d7de7c5cbbd8914",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]Clayton 先生[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]★★★★★[[CLOSE_2]][[OPEN_3]]5.0[[CLOSE_3]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bdb30d8552c210abbd33",
   "sourceHash": "bdb30d8552c210abbd33ba01938d98af35c0f75fa74d685a01b2f86c3a5b536a",
   "text": "该项目涵盖哪些神经系统疾病？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7198732b583c9a98d80e",
   "sourceHash": "7198732b583c9a98d80e82151f47fee24fdc097cec23df5ebfe6d728042668e8",
   "text": "请提供您的诊断以及您目前需要的支持。咨询该项目是否适合您的病情，以及它将如何与神经科和康复治疗相配合。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2218908879fd68945f0b",
   "sourceHash": "2218908879fd68945f0bca09fd4e9268f3ae4c26744d9f4cb094a87a3c171098",
   "text": "阿育吠陀神经疗法：维护神经系统健康",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ae7095049159f46d6849",
   "sourceHash": "ae7095049159f46d6849dc0b186ba1f43aaad6bc7ee46baedd6631e23d41e4ee",
   "text": "Kairali 治疗师用小黄铜器皿将温热的药油倒在一位坐着的患者头顶",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_75258d3e9e7dff39a0a6",
   "sourceHash": "75258d3e9e7dff39a0a696262e36c460bd2446015cd106a7098e56e66c01cf71",
   "text": "两名治疗师在一只黄铜油碗旁为患者的双腿进行药油按摩",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_194432efb272c727f503",
   "sourceHash": "194432efb272c727f503ec4590de9df997cbc2887509a60defdf709868697e5c",
   "text": "阿育吠陀治疗神经功能障碍的益处",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cca069676fd4a8e0ae2d",
   "sourceHash": "cca069676fd4a8e0ae2dab52988f841dc6500b81405ae2f09abd3260786cf2de",
   "text": "：我们首先进行详细的问诊，了解您的病史、当前症状以及可能与您的神经功能障碍有关的生活方式因素。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_14b3c34c922302141f7c",
   "sourceHash": "14b3c34c922302141f7cc46c1fa430a23ef585645fb4f1726fa7a03dfbc6c099",
   "text": "：我们进行全面检查，以确定您独特的 dosha（体质能量）构成，并找出可能导致您病情的任何失衡。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cf7a63bdbfed5b33327a",
   "sourceHash": "cf7a63bdbfed5b33327a0c43b0f3e8c53793a713a0c468b59c4a67ca59df6d68",
   "text": "个性化治疗项目方案",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f5fe8d0dbd43fdd6bcaf",
   "sourceHash": "f5fe8d0dbd43fdd6bcaf5c45aacf4ec9c4bea93edc3a831ddae73c52302c0a2d",
   "text": "：根据问诊和 dosha 评估，我们为您量身制定符合您具体需求的个性化治疗方案。该方案结合了多种阿育吠陀疗法和药物。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_955cd49f8ca329ac0d8e",
   "sourceHash": "955cd49f8ca329ac0d8ea79f34adda2c87e9cb47d368a32871eca84dbdfa4879",
   "text": "：我们经验丰富的治疗师会实施 Shirodhara（希罗达拉）、Abhyangam（阿比扬伽）、Nasyam（那斯亚）等专门疗法，以平衡 dosha、安抚神经系统并促进康复。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d528dbbbeb4058902109",
   "sourceHash": "d528dbbbeb4058902109da8a118a44102556fb0a99a4fd0f9c60dc6fdb1601a4",
   "text": "：我们会开具由天然草药和矿物制成的阿育吠陀药物，以调理潜在的失衡，并支持神经系统的恢复活力。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_be11a7f85c031523e4db",
   "sourceHash": "be11a7f85c031523e4db6d3b280df4002af3f86ec99734b43f04444fe9e982b5",
   "text": "定期监测",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_58965705601c4fa53707",
   "sourceHash": "58965705601c4fa53707eb4baa62099b660c1f917e2eaa532ab453aa20d22233",
   "text": "：在您住院期间，我们的团队会监测您的进展，必要时调整治疗方案，并确保您的舒适与健康。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'stay at our retreat' rendered as 住院期间 (during your stay/admission) to avoid resort framing."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d10755e67cf90c9adf62",
   "sourceHash": "d10755e67cf90c9adf62d61fc8189d692127f1f0c1a24579edad5cf89f83a3d0",
   "text": "健康教育与自我管理",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_363f204316a6d0ae8594",
   "sourceHash": "363f204316a6d0ae85948be3a71f2ead07982e70fca2bc7d0ce9886e9cfa679b",
   "text": "：我们会向您讲解阿育吠陀原理、自我护理方法，以及在出院后仍能保持神经系统平衡的策略。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'leaving the retreat' rendered as 出院后 (after discharge) to avoid resort framing."
   ]
  }
 ]
}
